# Normalise line endings in the repository; check out LF everywhere.
#
# The audit trail hashes the canonical bytes of a record and the mutation and
# prove-suites harnesses match multi-line anchors, so a CRLF/LF flip would
# change behaviour between machines. Keeping the tree LF-only means the tool
# and its harnesses behave identically on Windows and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.py   text diff=python
*.md   text
*.yml  text
*.txt  text